  {
   "text": "Kate drove to Acadia in December for the Park Loop Road.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.677
  },
  {
   "text": "From December first to April fourteenth, most of it is closed to cars.",
   "start": 3.927,
   "end": 7.875
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: in winter, walk the carriage roads instead.",
   "start": 8.175,
   "end": 11.247
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Acadia trip.",
   "start": 11.547,
   "end": 13.334
